OL,3,GNEWSAAnalysis: Nesbitt's departure
OL,4,Aproves politics can't be removed from
OL,5,Ahealth
OL,6,
OL,7,FMike Nesbitt's sudden and somewhat
OL,8,Fdramatic departure as health minister
OL,9,Fshould come as no surprise.
OL,11,FThe move came on Tuesday, amid a a
OL,12,Fclash over withdrawing emergency
OL,13,Fgeneral surgery services from Causeway
OL,14,FHospital, with the UUP leader Jon
OL,15,FBurrows.
